      "cooked": "<p>i have been working on development of project managemnent module for designing team.<br>\ni have to add customize feild name Discipline in task wich has to go through a workflow.</p>\n<p>on submitting thetimesheet i keep on getting getting error msg :<br>\nRow <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#3:</span> Discipline cannot be “MEP”. It should be one of “Design Task”</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/7/f7e7251948513ad318941b2dd242734cd3604f24.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f7e7251948513ad318941b2dd242734cd3604f24\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/7/f7e7251948513ad318941b2dd242734cd3604f24_2_690x433.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zn39Yvnx97pe81RVobv8docgycQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"433\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/7/f7e7251948513ad318941b2dd242734cd3604f24_2_690x433.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/7/f7e7251948513ad318941b2dd242734cd3604f24_2_1035x649.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/7/f7e7251948513ad318941b2dd242734cd3604f24.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"686868\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1350×849 46.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
